Scope of this licence
----------------------

This MIT licence covers this repository: the `web/` framework and every
tool rewritten with it (`web/src/`, built by CI into the site that is
published from the `gh-pages` branch), `docs/`, `tests/`, the
clean-room tool `text-fx` (inspired by くま。's 文字画像APNGメーカー;
no code taken from it), and the redirect pages under `tools/` that send
old addresses to the rewritten tools.

Some rewritten tools adapt code, templates or presets from upstream
projects under open licences (MIT, CC0, Unlicense, Apache-2.0). Those
parts keep their upstream copyright and licence: each such tool carries
the upstream licence in `web/src/tools/<id>/UPSTREAM_LICENSE`, and the
build collects them, together with the npm dependencies' licences, in
the site's `assets/build/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. See `ATTRIBUTION.md`
for the inspiration and source of every tool.

